{
  "entries": {
    "peak_depletion_failure": {
      "title": "結局一（兩者興奮度歸零）",
      "steps": [
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "……",
          "source_row": 3,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "……那、那個……",
          "source_row": 4,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "…………",
          "source_row": 5,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "（哇，完全不理人。但仔細想想，是我的技術太差勁了，又不懂哄人開心……）",
          "source_row": 6,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "……對不起。",
          "source_row": 7,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "……罷了，至少你有停下來，不是逼我繼續。",
          "source_row": 8,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "以這點來說，你還算……勉強及格啦。",
          "source_row": 9,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "（嗯？他剛剛……是安慰我嗎？）",
          "source_row": 10,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "咳、咳嗯……不過你技術還是很糟、很爛，這是事實，今天你也搞砸了，這也是事實。只是……",
          "source_row": 11,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "……以後如果還有機會的話，也不是……不可以。",
          "source_row": 12,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "沒有顧慮對象的情緒與不稱職的愛撫，你無疑搞砸了今夜的美好時光，但幸好，你並沒有在他真的很不舒服時選擇強迫對方……",
          "source_row": 13,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "多虧如此，這把小提琴雖然不滿，卻沒有憤怒，性愛中的失敗不過尋常，但你很清楚，只要彼此願意，你們隨時都可以進行新的「調音」——",
          "source_row": 14,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "physical_imbalance_failure": {
      "title": "結局二（只有生理興奮度滿）",
      "steps": [
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "哈啊……啊啊……不要、不要了……",
          "source_row": 18,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "「不要」？為什麼不要了？你不是很舒服嗎？你瞧——",
          "source_row": 19,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "唔……唔啊！！",
          "source_row": 20,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "……！？怎、怎麼了？",
          "source_row": 22,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "……不要……哈啊……",
          "source_row": 23,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "昏、昏過去了？不會吧？喂！喂！？",
          "source_row": 24,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "…………",
          "source_row": 25,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "剛剛還叫的那樣浪、那樣大聲，怎麼就這樣沒了？不過……",
          "source_row": 26,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "剛剛的聲音，比其合奏，更像是哀號……這真的是舒服的嗎？還是說，其實他不想要這樣的感覺？",
          "source_row": 27,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "…………",
          "source_row": 28,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "……算了，他也回答不了我。先清理一下附近吧。",
          "source_row": 29,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "小提琴的聲音愈發高亢、走調、哀鳴，都被你視若無物，等回過神來時，他已經如同崩斷的琴弦，整個人軟趴趴的癱倒在床上，彷彿昏了過去。",
          "source_row": 30,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "你被迫停了下來，心中慾火難消，然而眼前的小提琴已經承受不了任何「憐愛」，猶如死物一樣躺在白色床單上，奄奄一息。",
          "source_row": 31,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "只剩下虛弱的、空虛的、沒有任何溫存的，哀哀弦鳴——",
          "source_row": 32,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "emotional_imbalance_failure": {
      "title": "結局三 （只有心理興奮度滿）",
      "steps": [
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "唔……！",
          "source_row": 36,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "怎、怎麼了？不舒服嗎？我太用力了？還是太粗魯了？",
          "source_row": 37,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "……是沒有，話說你幹嘛這樣畏畏縮縮的，我又不是玻璃人偶，一碰就破。",
          "source_row": 38,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "我、我只是不希望你不舒服嘛……",
          "source_row": 39,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "還是，你覺得我這樣溫柔反而沒意思了？嫌棄我技術不好？",
          "source_row": 40,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "…………",
          "source_row": 41,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "喂！你別不說話啊！喂——",
          "source_row": 42,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "咕、咕嚕——",
          "source_row": 43,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "…………",
          "source_row": 44,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "…………",
          "source_row": 45,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "噗……噗哈哈哈！我、我肚子餓了……抱歉，抱歉……",
          "source_row": 46,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "吼！氣氛都沒了啦……算了算了，走，去吃宵夜！",
          "source_row": 47,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "不知是運氣不好，或者純粹是因技術不足，你雖盡自己所能，卻終究沒能讓小提琴完全沉浸其中。",
          "source_row": 48,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "不過，或許是始終有照顧到對方的心情，他的表情清爽愉悅，與你們第一次相遇時已是大不相同，或許……這是好的開始？",
          "source_row": 49,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "你們一邊吃著消夜，一邊有一搭沒一搭地聊起了天，彼此間沒有半點床地情事失敗的窘迫。",
          "source_row": 50,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "因為你很清楚，只要彼此願意，你們隨時都能開始一段「新的調音」——",
          "source_row": 51,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "success": {
      "title": "結局三 （兩者皆滿，好結局）",
      "steps": [
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "哈啊……哈啊……唔！",
          "source_row": 56,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "（好重……明明是小提琴卻這麼重真是有夠反直覺！但是……）",
          "source_row": 57,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "（能夠感受到他那全身心的重量都靠在自己身上，水乳交融，彷彿我與他本該就是一體。）",
          "source_row": 58,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "小提琴的琴聲悠揚，在你的觸手中發出僅有他才能發出的，連綿而悠揚的音調。",
          "source_row": 59,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "這……真的是我的聲音？原來、原來我能發出這樣……？",
          "source_row": 60,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "嗯，是你的聲音……很好聽呢。",
          "source_row": 61,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "…………",
          "source_row": 62,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "小提琴",
          "text": "……太好了，我不是壞掉的小提琴……",
          "source_row": 63,
          "character": {
            "base": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/complete.png",
            "layers": [
              {
                "id": "phase_2_negative_face",
                "path": "res://assets/art/character/phase2/face_negative.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "他抽噎了幾聲，隨後像是想起你還在場，立刻拉了旁邊的枕頭遮住自己的臉。即便如此，也能聽到枕頭下依稀的聲響……",
          "source_row": 64,
